    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/legacy-book-club/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Legacy Book Club is an elegant and versatile theme crafted for book clubs, literary communities, online and independent book clubs, reading circles, book discussion forums, online book communities, book lovers’ networks, bookstores, online bookstores, secondhand book shops, vintage book stores, comic book shops, children’s book stores, eBook stores, and literary event organizers. Designed to provide an engaging platform for members to share book recommendations, organize book readings, author signings, workshops, and club events, it offers a user-friendly interface for both administrators and visitors. The theme features a responsive and retina-ready design, ensuring smooth performance on desktops, tablets, and smartphones. With sections for customizable banners, call-to-action buttons, book promotions, bestseller showcases, membership programs, testimonials, and social media integration, it helps create a visually appealing and interactive experience. Integrated with the Bookly plugin, it enables event booking, membership management, and appointment scheduling for club meetings or author sessions. With SEO-optimized structure, fast loading speed, and clean design, Legacy Book Club empowers book clubs, bookstores, and literary organizations to build a professional, community-driven, and engaging online presence that attracts readers, promotes events, and fosters a love for books."
    },
